<div id="S3.SS6.p4" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S3.SS6.p4.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S3.SS6.p4.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Complexity Metrics:</span> Our generated codebases exhibit realistic complexity distributions with cyclomatic complexity scores ranging from 0.3 to 1.0, file counts between 10-100 per project, and documentation ratios exceeding industry standards. Automated validation ensures all code compiles successfully and maintains architectural coherence.</p>
</div>
