</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
</div>
<div id="A2.SS6.SSS4.p3" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.SS6.SSS4.p3.1" class="ltx_p">These sophisticated prompt templates ensure consistent, high-quality evaluation across all programming languages and task categories while maintaining the flexibility needed for comprehensive long-context assessment.</p>
</div>
</section>
</section>
</section>
<section id="A3" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix C </span>More Experimental Results</h2>

<div id="A3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">This appendix presents the complete experimental results, containing all evaluation metrics for all 13 models.</p>
</div>
<section id="A3.SS1" class="ltx_subsection">
