<p id="A3.SS2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Table <a href="#A3.T8" title="Table 8 ‣ C.2 Performance by Difficulty Level ‣ Appendix C More Experimental Results ‣ LoCoBench: A Benchmark for Long-Context Large Language Models in Complex Software Engineering" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">8</span></a> presents model performance across four difficulty levels from Easy (10K-100K tokens) to Expert (500K-1M tokens).</p>
