<section id="A3.SS5" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">C.5 </span>Performance by Application Domain</h3>

<div id="A3.SS5.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.SS5.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Table <a href="#A3.T12" title="Table 12 ‣ C.5 Performance by Application Domain ‣ Appendix C More Experimental Results ‣ LoCoBench: A Benchmark for Long-Context Large Language Models in Complex Software Engineering" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">12</span></a> presents the complete results of model performance across different application domains.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A3.T12" class="ltx_table">

<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 12: </span>Detailed comparison of model performance by application domain.</figcaption><div class="ltx_flex_figure">
